### Day 3 express-steps: requests for the REST Client extension (VS Code). Start ONE step at a time on port 5000.
@host = http://localhost:5000

### 02 health
GET {{host}}/api/health

### 03 params and query
GET {{host}}/api/echo/42

###
GET {{host}}/api/search?q=asha&page=2

### 03 body
POST {{host}}/api/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hello": "world" }

### 04 without key (401)
GET {{host}}/api/private

### 04 with key (200)
GET {{host}}/api/private
x-api-key: secret123

### 05-09 list
GET {{host}}/api/employees

### 05-09 one
GET {{host}}/api/employees/1

### create (valid)
POST {{host}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test User", "email": "test@iitk.ac.in", "position": "Developer", "department": "IT", "salary": 50000 }

### 01 raw http POST (collects the body by hand)
POST {{host}}/api/echo
Content-Type: application/json

{ "hello": "raw node" }

### 02 POST a message (express.json + app.post)
POST {{host}}/api/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "hi" }

### 04 POST with the API key (without the header: 401)
POST {{host}}/api/private
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: secret123

{ "note": "protected POST" }

### 07 / 09 / backend: duplicate email (409). Send the "create (valid)" request below twice.

### create (invalid: 400 from step 06 on)
POST {{host}}/api/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": " ", "email": "nope", "salary": -5 }

### partial update
PATCH {{host}}/api/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "salary": 65000 }

### delete (204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/employees/2

### 07 missing employee (404) and crash (500, step 07 only)
GET {{host}}/api/employees/99

###
GET {{host}}/api/crash

### 08 search, sort, pages, stats
GET {{host}}/api/employees?department=IT&sort=-salary&page=1&limit=2

###
GET {{host}}/api/employees/stats
